<section id="A2.SS2.SSS4" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">B.2.4 </span>More baselines</h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We include more training-free baselines and achieve superior fidelity in Tab. <a href="#A2.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ B.2.4 More baselines ‣ B.2 More Experiment Results ‣ Appendix B More Experiments ‣ SODA: Sensitivity-Oriented Dynamic Acceleration for Diffusion Transformer" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> (<math id="A2.SS2.SSS4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math>-DiT is not open-sourced, so we adopt its setting).</p>
</div>
